<view class="page"><view class="label">每一局，都值得记住</view><view class="section-title">我的战绩</view><view class="stats" wx:if="{{stats}}"><view><text>{{stats.rounds}}</text>完成局数</view><view><text>{{stats.wins}}</text>获胜局数</view><view><text>{{stats.firsts}}</text>头游次数</view><view><text>{{stats.biggestBomb}}</text>最大炸弹张数</view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取战绩…</view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !history.length}}">还没有完成的牌局<view class="muted">完成一局后，在这里回顾排名。</view></view><view class="record" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="index"><view class="record-heading"><text>{{item.won ? '本队获胜' : '再接再厉'}}</text><text>{{item.winner}} 队 +{{item.upgrade}} 级</text></view><view class="hint">房间 {{item.roomId}} · 第 {{item.round}} 局 · {{item.date}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.names}}</view></view><view class="button-row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新战绩</button><button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回大厅</button></view></view>